    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;be two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;matrices such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
